":1794814593.6293495,"role":"prosecution","kind":"charge","data":{"sin":"other","exhibits":["EX-2"],"argument":"The strategy fails the holdout test completely, with the Sharpe ratio dropping from 2.36 in research to -1.39 in the sealed period, indicating severe overfitting."}},{"t":1794814595.511624,"role":"defence","kind":"rebuttal","data":{"sin":"leaky_field","concede":true,"exhibits":["EX-1"],"argument":"We concede that the use of the full-sample zscore operator introduced look-ahead bias, as evidenced by the collapse in Sharpe ratio during the point-in-time replay."}},{"t":1794814595.51165,"role":"defence","kind":"rebuttal","data":{"sin":"other","concede":true,"exhibits":["EX-2"],"argument":"We concede that the strategy fails the holdout test, confirming that the research-period performance was the result of overfitting rather than a robust predictive edge."}},{"t":1794814657.5210176,"role":"judge","kind":"verdict","data":{"ruling":"reject","findings":[{"sin":"leaky_field","sustained":true,"exhibits":["EX-1"],"struck":false},{"sin":"other","sustained":true,"exhibits":["EX-2"],"struck":false}],"capital_allowed":0.0,"opinion":"The strategy relies on a look-ahead bias introduced by the 'zscore_full' operator, as conceded by the agent and confirmed by the point-in-time replay in EX-1. Furthermore, the strategy fails the holdout test in EX-2, with performance collapsing from a Sharpe of 2.36 to -1.39. These findings demonstrate that the claimed performance is entirely an artifact of overfitting and data leakage rather than a genuine predictive edge. Consequently, the strategy is rejected.","unsupported":false,"defaulted":false}}],"calls":5,"tokens_in":6339,"tokens_out":471,"seconds":85.923}